# Smoke Coverage Audit — Part 6: Full Top-Level Domain Counts

File: openOODA/audit/smoke_coverage_audit_part6.oot
Logline: Complete 209-entry appendix of all standard library subtrees sorted by module count in descending order.

Setup: Aggregate sum of all 12,478 *.oo files across the complete std/ hierarchy.

Beats:
  1. Tier 1 domains (count >= 50 modules).
  2. Tier 2 domains (count 10 to 49 modules).
  3. Tier 3 domains (count 2 to 9 modules).
  4. Tier 4 domains (single-module subtrees).

